 </div>\n                </article>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"proyectos-title\" class=\"mt-32 mb-24 md:mt-40\" data-kid=\"1-5-4\" data-name=\"projects section\" id=\"proyectos\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-1\" data-name=\"projects header\">\n                <h2 class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--green)] md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-1-1\" data-name=\"projects title\" id=\"proyectos-title\">\n                    <iconify-icon data-kid=\"1-5-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"projects icon\" icon=\"mdi:briefcase-outline\" style=\"color:var(--green);width:28px;height:28px\">\n                    </iconify-icon>\n                    Últimos trabajos\n                </h2>\n                <div class=\"section-rule mt-2 h-px w-full flex-1 md:ml-6 md:mt-0\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-1-2\" data-name=\"section rule line 3\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-7 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2\" data-name=\"projects grid\">\n                <article class=\"project-card group glass-card relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl p-5\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-1\" data-name=\"project card 1\">\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"project body 1\">\n                        <h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-white transition group-hover:text-[var(--green)]\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"project title 1\">\n                            Mind Your English\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-[1.6] text-gray-300\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"project description 1\">\n                            Sitio web institucional para fortalecer la identidad digital y la captación de nuevos alumnos.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"project tags container 1\">\n                            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"project tag 1-1\">\n                                <iconify-icon data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"project tag icon 1-1\" icon=\"simple-icons:astro\" style=\"color:currentColor;width:12px;height:12px\">\n                                </iconify-icon>\n                                Astro\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-[#003159] px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"project tag 1-2\">\n                                Tailwind CSS\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[var(--dark-border)]/40\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-1-1-4\" data-name=\"project image wrapper 1\">\n                            <img alt=\"Captura de pantalla del proyecto Mind Your English\" class=\"project-image aspect-video w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"project image 1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/img/works/mindyourenglish.png\" width=\"420\"/>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                <article class=\"project-card group glass-card relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl p-5\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-2\" data-name=\"project card 2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"project body 2\">\n                        <h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-white transition group-hover:text-[var(--green)]\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"project title 2\">\n                            Axolmen E-commerce\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-[1.6] text-gray-300\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"project description 2\">\n                            Plataforma de comercio electrónico a medida con gestión de inventario y pedidos.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"project tags container 2\">\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"project tag 2-1\">\n                                Next.js\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-[#003159] px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"project tag 2-2\">\n                                Tailwind CSS\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[var(--dark-border)]/40\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"project image wrapper 2\">\n                            <img alt=\"Captura de pantalla del proyecto Axolmen E-commerce\" class=\"project-image aspect-video w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"project image 2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/img/works/axolmen.png\" width=\"420\"/>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                <article class=\"project-card group glass-card relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl p-5\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-3\" data-name=\"project card 3\">\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"project body 3\">\n                        <h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-white transition group-hover:text-[var(--green)]\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"project title 3\">\n                            Code Verse\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-[1.6] text-gray-300\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"project description 3\">\n                            Sitio corporativo de alto rendimiento para una startup tecnológica.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-3-1-3\" data-name=\"project tags container 3\">\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"project tag 3-1\">\n                                Next.js\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-[#003159] px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"project tag 3-2\">\n                                Tailwind CSS\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[var(--dark-border)]/40\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-3-1-4\" data-name=\"project image wrapper 3\">\n                            <img alt=\"Captura de pantalla del proyecto Code Verse\" class=\"project-image aspect-video w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-3-1-4-1\" data-name=\"project image 3\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/img/works/codeverse.png\" width=\"420\"/>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                <article class=\"project-card group glass-card relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl p-5\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-4\" data-name=\"project card 4\">\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-4-1\" data-name=\"project body 4\">\n                        <h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-white transition group-hover:text-[var(--green)]\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"project title 4\">\n                            Sultepec Turístico\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-[1.6] text-gray-300\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"project description 4\">\n                            Portal digital oficial para el fomento del turismo del municipio de Sultepec.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-4-1-3\" data-name=\"project tags container 4\">\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-black\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-4-1-3-1\" data-name=\"project tag 4-1\">\n                                Mysql\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-4-1-3-2\" data-name=\"project tag 4-2\">\n                                Next.js\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[var(--dark-border)]/40\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-4-1-4\" data-name=\"project image wrapper 4\">\n                            <img alt=\"Captura de pantalla del proyecto Sultepec Turístico\" class=\"project-image aspect-video w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-5-4-2-4-1-4-1\" data-name=\"project image 4\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/img/works/sultepec.png\" width=\"420\"/>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"mt-32 pb-8 md:mt-40\" data-kid=\"1-5-5\" data-name=\"about section\" id=\"sobre-mi\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-5-5-1\" data-name=\"about header\">\n                <h2 class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--blue)] md:text-4xl\" data-kid=\"1-5-5-1-1\" data-name=\"about title\">\n                    <iconify-icon data-kid=\"1-5-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"about icon\" icon=\"mdi:account-circle-outline\" style=\"color:var(--blue);width:28px;height:28px\">\n                    </iconify-icon>\n                    Sobre mi\n                </h2>\n                <div class=\"section-rule mt-2 h-px w-full flex-1 md:ml-6 md:mt-0\" data-kid=\"1-5-5-1-2\" data-name=\"section rule line 4\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--dark-border)]/50 bg-[var(--dark-surface)]/40 p-6 text-gray-300 md:p-8\" data-kid=\"1-5-5-2\" data-name=\"about card\">\n                <p class=\"max-w-3xl text-base leading-[1.8] md:text-lg\" data-kid=\"1-5-5-2-1\" data-name=\"about description\">\n                    Hola, soy\n                    <strong class=\"text-white\" data-kid=\"1-5-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"about name highlight\">\n                        Lizandro Antonio Santos\n                    </strong>\n                    , un desarrollador apasionado y eterno autodidacta. Busco disfrutar cada faceta de mi vida al máximo, aplicando la misma dedicación a mis proyectos de software que a mis pasiones personales.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <footer class=\"mt-12 border-t border-[var(--dark-border)]/30 py-10 text-center\" data-kid=\"1-5-6\" data-name=\"page footer\">\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\" data-kid=\"1-5-6-1\" data-name=\"footer copyright\">\n                © 2024\n                <span class=\"font-medium text-gray-400\" data-kid=\"1-5-6-1-1\" data-name=\"copyright name\">\n                    Lizandro Antonio Santos\n                